    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Love, passion. Hooks, Sharks.</h2>Hooksharks is an open-source local multiplayer game about glory, and most of all, battling sharks.<br><br>Enter the arena and venture through the two exciting game modes: \u201cRacing\u201d and \u201cDeathmatch\u201d.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gotta go fast!</h2><br>In \u201cRacing\u201d mode you and your friends will fight for glory inside the game's exciting and hazard-filled tracks. You'll find several items and power-ups to your shark that will help you hook your way to the first place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It's the thrill of the fight!</h2><br>The &quot;Deathmatch&quot; maps are destined for the most skilled and brave gladiators of the arena: no tricks, no training wheels: just you, your shark and a blazing trail of flammable oil, until there's only one left!",
